{"product_id":"how-to-prevent-the-next-pandemic","title":"How to Prevent the Next Pandemic","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"590\"\u003eImagine if the next pandemic didn’t take the world by surprise. Imagine a world where scientists, governments, and communities were ready before a virus could spread. Bill Gates takes you on a riveting journey through the lessons of COVID-19 and shows exactly how we can stop the next global health crisis before it begins.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"983\"\u003eThis isn’t just a book about viruses; it’s a blueprint for action. From creating rapid-response “fire departments” for epidemics, to revolutionary vaccines, to strengthening health systems worldwide, Gates lays out a clear, practical plan to protect humanity. Insightful, urgent, and surprisingly optimistic, this book is a must-read for anyone who cares about the future of global health.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1581\"\u003eAuthor: Bill Gates\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1621\"\u003ePublisher: \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1649\"\u003eISBN: 9780593534489\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1652\" data-end=\"1695\"\u003eFormat: Hardcover \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1714\"\u003ePages: 256\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45747096649881,"sku":"17RA-6-9780593534489","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/9781802060522-jacket-large.webp?v=1758816991","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/how-to-prevent-the-next-pandemic","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}